{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act16d5_level_act16d5_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act16d5",
  "stageId": "act16d5_05",
  "title": "Crude Mounts",
  "storyCode": "WR-5",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "79680daaf6635edb301d53e2ad46998c4dddc37738f977b8fe497470d8de362a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lava",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "What was that woman called?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saga",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga#4",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "I know not."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lava",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "He never asked?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saga",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga#4",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "He never dared."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lava",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saga",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "Moreover, when dreams seem fantasy, truth seems false, when what passes is perhaps a year, yet may be a snap of the fingers—between other worlds—where should one go to ask?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lava",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saga",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "Traveling the country of Yan, I inevitably find myself thinking back on this story. Poring over it, it may have only been my head priest putting on a show for me, haphazardly making up a story."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saga",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "But in my queries all across Yan, I was surprised to find this 'Scene of Crude Mounts Utmost Risen' has some small reputation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saga",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "'Twas said it was an obscure artist about a hundred years prior who left it, and past relatives of the Emperor could not obtain it with all their riches, giving it its fame."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saga",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "By fortune I was close to Mount Hui-ch'i, and I had the sudden thought to take this chance, to see whether or not I could find the sublime scenery in that painting..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saga",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "Hah hah. I found enchanting hills and waters in the mountains, and before I could react, I had already ended up here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lava",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "The cottage on Mount Hui-ch'i. That's exactly where we were too..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lava",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "Could this place be a dream?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saga",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "If it were a dream, then to thee, I would only be its illusion, and thou would be unable to trust my words."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saga",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "If thou art unable to trust, then how dost thou judge the scenery before thee, Lava? Is it a dream, or not?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lava",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "Slow down... you're gonna give me a headache..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lava",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "Okay, then do you know how to get out of here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saga",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "Traveling to this day, I still have not come to understand how I may leave of my own accord."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lava",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "To this day? How long have you been staying in here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saga",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga#4",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "For a very, very long time. Allow me to count..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dawn",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Your tea'll get cold soon. Don't get lost chatting; give the tea a taste."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lava",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "Ah... thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lava",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "(Phew...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lava",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "Hm? Now that we mention it, Miss Dawn, don't tell me you're also...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dawn",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm just a local pawnbroker."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dawn",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Miss Lava... I really appreciate your kindness, and admire your intent to protect the villagers from the Ink Spirits, but please think more about your own safety, if you have the time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lava",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "Those monsters aren't a threat to Rhodes Island's elite."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saga",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "Words without falsehood. The good Lava is a person of fine ability. You need not worry!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dawn",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If true, then I suppose it's alright."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dawn",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Miss Lava, I've got a question, and I'm not sure whether I should ask it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lava",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "Ask away. You don't really need to be that reserved with me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dawn",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Miss Lava, have you ever looked close at the moon in the water?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dawn",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No matter how the moonlight in the water is torn apart gleaming on the waves, when all comes to a calm, it will still be that same full moon."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dawn",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If you pity the moonlight in that time it flickers across the water, then it's not at all necessary you wet your shoes and brave the cold."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dawn",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Miss Lava, so as to fish up that moon in the water, would you... give your utmost thought?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lava",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "I... I don't think I would? There's not much sense in doing things like that, is there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lava",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "What's got you mentioning this out of nowhere?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dawn",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I don't know what that bright moon of yours looks like, Miss Lava, and I have no way to point out where you're falling short. But the moon in the water, in the end, is only the moon in the water."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dawn",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's not necessary to do it for our sakes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lava",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "You mean...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mr. Nothing",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "Benefactors! My benefactors! You're alright, aren't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, man, you even got tea going, and you still didn't call me over."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dawn",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I assume these two are also esteemed guests of P'o-shan Village? I'll go brew the tea, and bring some pastries too. Take your time to chat."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And who might this be?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lava",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "The shopkeeper here. She's called Dawn. Dawn like the daybreak."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mr. Nothing",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "Benefactor, what of those Ink Spirits? Oho, I see! Surely, with your invincible might, you drove them all away!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lava",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "—Is that little girl safe yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She's safe. Safe and sound."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mr. Nothing",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "Ohh, ohh, benefactor, how could you doubt me so... I've waded through dangers extreme without shedding a tear, and now I am somewhat sad...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dawn",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Here's your tea."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mmm... I can tell it's expensive with just a whiff."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mr. Nothing",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "How insightful, benefactor! Plain folk like me could only reckon it bitter. We'd never make sense of the taste."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dawn",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's just ordinary tea. They only sell this one kind in the market. Please forgive me if it doesn't suit you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Phhaahh~ I might be used to black tea and coffee, but there's just this special kind of taste to Yan tea whenever I try it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saga",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga#1",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "My hometown also has tea whose flavor can be said to be unique. If the chance should come, thou must allow me to display my skills."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lava",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "Haaahhh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alright there, Lava? You getting sleepy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lava",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "I'm not. I just kind of chilled out suddenly..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dawn",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Tea nourishes the heart. What troubles you can't be resolved just by rushing about."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lava",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "We still don't have much of a lead."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saga",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga#1",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "In the world within the painting, one can only take things slowly."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lava",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "Oh, yeah! Saga, have you ever seen this thing before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saga",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga#2",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "I do not know at all... Only, I know not why, but I feel I have seen this object somewhere in the past..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lava",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "Really?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saga",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga#4",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "Allow me to think... ho... this texture... this material... I have, somewhen, somewhere, experienced it before..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dawn",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The light reflecting off the tea..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lava",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "What's up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mr. Nothing",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "Ho-hohh!? What's happening? Why is everyone standing up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saga",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga#2",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "The sky?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dawn",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's turning day...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ink Spirit",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Gkhaa!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Villager",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_140#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "H—How did these things get near here?! This is the noontime street!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Villager",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_140#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "N—No, the horizon... wh... when did the sun move over there? What's happening in Mount Hung-tung!?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ink Spirit",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Gkhaa!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Villager",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_140#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Aaaghhh! These things, they're—they're eating people—! Run, get out of here!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Storyteller",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...It passes on just like this, sun rising and moon setting, as it should be."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Storyteller",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hmph."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Storyteller",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Does she mean... to disturb my peace?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lava",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "What... what's happening?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lava",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "Why would the sun...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—This is how the sun's meant to be, Lava."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lava",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "Huh? Well, of course I know that, yeah, I'm just wondering why it went back to normal—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lava",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "Wait. Right. This is what's normal... what I was just thinking...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mr. Nothing",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "Benefactors, why do I sense a great commotion in the village that way?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Villager",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Help me—help me! Help—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ink Spirit",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Gkhaa!"
